message: "If you use the derived tables or the code, please cite the archived version of record."
type: software
title: "Derived tables and code for 'Where in-sewer level records stop decides whether surcharge duration can be estimated'"
abstract: >-
  Derived tables and plotting code behind every figure and table of the
  manuscript on the observability of surcharge duration in in-sewer level
  records. Raw level records are not included. Code is MIT; the CSV files under
  outputs/ are CC BY 4.0.
